    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d498-a1">

                <pb facs="0461" n="345" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg345"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 11, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The two Rodriguez and Horacio Vásquez, en route to Cuba, arrived here today on
                    the French steamer. The Haitian Government refused to allow them to land.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Furniss.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
